### Greet - Simple greeting
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/greet

### Greet with Query Parameters
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/query?text=Hello%20World&repeatTimes=3

### Greet with Path Parameters
GET http://localhost:8080/hello/param/HelloFromPath?repeatTimes=2

### Greet with Body and Custom Header
POST http://localhost:8080/hello/body?necessaryParam=required
Content-Type: application/json
X-Custom-Header: CustomValue

{
  "text": "Hello from body request",
  "repeatTimes": 2
}

### Greet with Body and Different Custom Header
POST http://localhost:8080/hello/body?necessaryParam=required
Content-Type: application/json
X-Custom-Header: AnotherValue

{
  "text": "Testing header parsing",
  "repeatTimes": 3
}

### Greet with Body and No Custom Header
POST http://localhost:8080/hello/body?necessaryParam=required
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "No custom header here",
  "repeatTimes": 1
} 